                    <attribute id="CharacterCreationLevelName" type="FixedString" value="" />
                    <attribute id="Description" type="LSString" value="Pick a female body shape per character - Vanilla, SBBF or BCB - and your equipped clothing and armor refits to match. The choice is stored per character in your savegame and persists across save/load. Covers human/elf/half-elf/drow females and Githyanki females (including Lae'zel). Change the shape from the MCM panel, the !cm_setbody console command, or optional hotkeys. Requires MCM 1.19+ and BG3 Script Extender; SBBF and BCB are optional target shapes, not requirements. Optional add-ons ClothMorphSCO and ClothMorphBCB extend coverage to those source mods' garments." />
